From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:23:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/27] Mobile: Move the tile view controls into the screen
 header

The bar below the header (notebook filter, zoom buttons, layout toggle)
took too much vertical space. The notebook filter is now a header icon
next to the sort button (highlighted while a filter narrows the scope),
zoom and the list/tile toggle live in the header's overflow menu, and the
extra "Tiles" bar in the list layout is gone as well. Pinch zoom and the
notebook filter dialog are unchanged.

